        ExerciseCatalogEntry("air-bike", "Air Bike", "Quadriceps", "Other", "cardio_conditioning", "compound", "The air bike is a full-body conditioning machine that drives a fan with both the arms and the legs, so resistance scales with effort rather than with a dial. Short, hard intervals build work capacity while easy spinning serves as low-impact recovery. Keep the chest tall and push and pull the handles in rhythm with the pedals."),
        ExerciseCatalogEntry("archer-pull-ups", "Archer Pull Ups", "Lats", "Bodyweight", "strength_weighted_or_machine", "compound", "The archer pull up pulls the chest toward one hand while the opposite arm stays nearly straight, shifting almost the entire load onto the working side. Keep the straight arm from bending and pull the chin over the bent-arm hand; it is the bridge between regular pull ups and one-arm work."),
