        ExerciseCatalogEntry("banded-ankle-stretch", "Banded Ankle Stretch", "Calves", "Bands", "mobility_stretching", "isolation", "The banded ankle stretch anchors a band over the ankle joint and drives the knee forward over the toes, mobilizing the ankle joint as the calf lengthens. The band's posterior pull is what makes this version work where a plain lean stalls; keep the heel down throughout."),
        ExerciseCatalogEntry("banded-calf-stretch", "Banded Calf Stretch", "Calves", "Bands", "mobility_stretching", "isolation", "The banded calf stretch loops a band around the ball of the foot and pulls the toes back toward the shin with the leg straight. Keep the knee long to bias the gastrocnemius, then bend it slightly to reach the soleus; hold each version for 20 to 30 seconds."),
        ExerciseCatalogEntry("banded-chest-stretch", "Banded Chest Stretch", "Pectorals", "Bands", "mobility_stretching", "isolation", "The banded chest stretch holds a band wide behind the back and lifts the arms, opening the pecs and front shoulders. Walk the grip narrower to intensify or raise the arms to change the line of pull; keep the ribs down rather than arching into it."),
